1.0.6"}, {"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1778816895270, "description": "AI-driven full-project language migration skill. Use this skill whenever the user wants to port, translate, or rewrite a codebase from one programming language to another — including Python→Rust, Python→Go, Python→C, Python→C++, Python→Zig, Python→Bun/TS, or any other pair. Also trigger when user mentions \"精确复刻\", \"语言迁移\", \"port project\", \"translate codebase\", \"1:1 rewrite\", or \"language conversion\". This skill enforces structural equivalence first, full asset coverage (no file skipped), persistent YAML state across sessions, and a strict no-mock verification policy with human-gated blocking.", "description_zh": "lang-migration 是一个 AI技能 — 一份可迁移的、与代理无关的规范，它告诉任何有能力的LLM 确切地 如何迁移代码库、按什么顺序进行、需要什么证据、以及如何证明工作确实完成了。\n\n它不是你运行的工具。它是你安装到AI编码代理中的协议。\n\n可以把它想象成一份研究方法论，就像研究生遵循实验室协议一样 — 除了这份实验室协议是专门设计来检测和防止研究生（和LLM）倾向于走捷径的方式。", "downloads": 96, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_35d642b5/lang-migration", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/0c9b068f-f22e-44e2-96fe-d2b6f5b43b07.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "编程语言迁移 v1.3.1", "ownerName": "user_35d642b5", "score": 2674.83978824185, "slug": "lang-migration", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781277592399, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.3.1"}, {"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1778226320882, "description": "稳妥搭建 OpenClaw 多Agent协作的实施向导。当用户提到多Agent协作、Agent委派、Agent间通信、让某个Agent做任务、跨Agent任务分配、多智能体协作、agent collaboration、multi-agent、delegation 时触发。按环境检测、规划确认、备份实施、测试验证和委派规则沉淀的流程逐步引导。", "description_zh": "稳妥搭建 OpenClaw 多Agent协作的实施向导。当用户提到多Agent协作、Agent委派、Agent间通信、让某个Agent做任务、跨Agent任务分配、多智能体协作、agent collaboration、multi-agent、delegation 时触发。按环境检测、规划确认、备份实施、测试验证和委派规则沉淀的流程逐步引导。", "downloads": 96, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_5c543922/multi-agent-setup", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/e089b3bb-5a99-41bc-8881-40980028b748.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "multi-agent-setup", "ownerName": "user_5c543922", "score": 3995.0062421972534, "slug": "multi-agent-setup", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781275192613, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.3"}, {"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1776858896588, "description": "Compares multiple study-route options for the same biomedical research question and recommends one primary plan, while explicitly explaining why alternative routes are secondary, premature, weaker, or dependency-heavy. Always use this skill when the user already has a reasonably defined question but is unsure which main study route should anchor the project. Focus on plan comparison, route selection, dependency awareness, and primary-plan justification rather than full protocol drafting.", "description_zh": "Compares multiple study-route options for the same biomedical research question and recommends one primary plan, while explicitly explaining why alternative routes are secondary, premature, weaker, or dependency-heavy. Always use this skill when the user already has a reasonably defined question but is unsure which main study route should anchor the project. Focus on plan comparison, route selection, dependency awareness, and primary-plan justification rather than full protocol drafting.", "downloads": 96, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_c7479c7a/primary-plan-recommender", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/a00e31c7-8d6a